    "body": "I would like @smaug---- to double check as well since he filed the original issue.\r\n\r\nI saw that you filed browser bugs but I think browsers already handle this correctly. You can execute script during removal by using a `pagehide` listener in an `<iframe>` element's child document and making sure the `<iframe>` element gets removed if you want to double check. Only if that demonstrates something I think new tests would be warranted.",
